### Step 4: Inject the Detailed Live Stepper into the View Modal
Now we build the "Bigger Fit" detailed stepper at the top of the View Modal, right above the table.
**FIND THIS EXACT LINE (Inside your View Modal <DialogContent>):**
```javascript
        <DialogContent dividers sx={{ p: 0 }}>
